 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? Totally normal feeling. Roughly how long is each commute for you? Then start by finding routes that are as trafficked as yours but slower. There usually are options. Another trick is to start a lot earlier than you think you need. People still beat you on time then. Also, try to leave as late as you actually want to be leaving. People who leave early often end up taking longer in the end.",
